              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, pike and shield. May have light armour +2 pts. Macedonian Phalanx. Mixed Armour. 0-1 unit may be upgraded to Agema and is drilled and stubborn +5 pts. Pezhetairoi may be drilled +2 pts. Optional equipment: may replace the above equipment with sword, javelins, and shield, when they then cost 7 pts and may not form a phalanx (not built: all Pezhetairoi in the army must choose the same option). (Alexander the Great p.22)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
