              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, pike, light armour and shield. Macedonian Phalanx. Combined Formation. Mixed Armour. (EX) Only in the Alexandrian Imperial list. Note: if Epigonoi are used, then Pezhetairoi may not be taken - they have been sent home (not enforced). (Alexander the Great p.25)</characteristic>
