              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Heavy Ballista: Range 48", Strength 5/-1 per rank, no save, D4 wounds per hit. One extra crewman +6 pts. Crew of two men armed with swords; the crew may have shields +1 pt each, light armour +2 pts per crewman. Artillery may be grouped in batteries of three models. One war machine may be taken for each phalanx in the army. War machines may not have leaders, musicians or standards. (Alexander the Great p.22)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
