                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Crewed by an unarmed Mahout and one Macedonian soldier with light armour and a pike. Elephant. 0-1. At least one other (EX) unit must be in the army to allow an Elephant (not enforced). (Alexander the Great p.26)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
